===Alternative forms===
* {{l|de|Federweisser}} {{qualifier|Switzerland|Liechtenstein}}

===Etymology===
Of uncertain origin. Most likely a compound of {{compound|lang=de|Feder|tr1=feather|weiß|tr2=white}} from the appearance of the suspended yeast.

See also {{l|de|Federweiß}}.

