===Noun===
{{de-noun|m|Federweißen|Federweiße}} {{qualifier|der [[Federweiße]], ein Federweißer}}

# {{lb|de|oenology}} {{l|en|Federweisser}}, [[must]] made from white [[grapes]] that has begun to [[ferment]] but that has not yet turned into [[wine]]

